IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-RVV-INSITU-TRANS.

DATA DIVISION.
01 ROWS-COUNT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 COLS-COUNT          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 BLOCK-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 THROUGHPUT-GBPS     PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-RVV-TRANS.
    IF ROWS-COUNT == 0 OR COLS-COUNT == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    MOVE 48 TO THROUGHPUT-GBPS.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 ROWS-COUNT.
    WEIGHT 30 THROUGHPUT-GBPS.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
